      <marc:subfield code="a">&quot;This communication training DVD demonstrates how the inability to listen effectively can be detrimental to relationships; both workplace and personal. Viewers are shown several active listening techniques and how they ultimately enhance the communication process such as: respecting personal opinion; empathising; giving unspoken feedback; making eye contact; parapharasing and asking questions to clarify; not interrupting, blaming or criticising.&quot;--Container back cover.</marc:subfield>
